# Third-party tooling fetched into this directory

`vendor/` is gitignored. Its contents are fetched by a setup script at a pinned
commit rather than committed, because they are large and actively maintained
upstream — a stale copy would be worse than a pinned fetch. This file records
what belongs here and under what terms, and IS committed.

See also `ontology/NOTICE`, which covers content that *is* vendored, because it
is small and pinned to a specific published version.

